<!-- TESTIMONIALS -->
<section class="testimonials-section">
  <div class="section-header reveal">
    <h2 class="section-title">What Gamtu Customers Say</h2>
    <div class="underline-bar"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="testi-track-wrap" id="testiWrap">
    <div class="testi-track" id="testiTrack">
      <div class="testi-card"><div class="testi-stars">★★★★★</div><p class="testi-text">The A2 Ghee has completely changed our cooking. You can taste the difference — pure, fragrant, and absolutely delicious. My family can't imagine cooking without it now.</p><div class="testi-author"><div class="testi-avatar">🙎‍♀️</div><div><div class="testi-name">Priya Mehta</div><div class="testi-loc">Ahmedabad, Gujarat</div></div></div></div>
      <div class="testi-card"><div class="testi-stars">★★★★★</div><p class="testi-text">Fast delivery and premium packaging. The herbal tea is phenomenal — calming and aromatic. I've been ordering every month for the past year. Truly Satvik!</p><div class="testi-author"><div class="testi-avatar">🧔</div><div><div class="testi-name">Rajesh Sharma</div><div class="testi-loc">Mumbai, Maharashtra</div></div></div></div>
      <div class="testi-card"><div class="testi-stars">★★★★★</div><p class="testi-text">The Jain Instant Soup is a lifesaver during fasting. So wholesome and tasty. The dry fruits are also top quality — you can feel the freshness in every bite.</p><div class="testi-author"><div class="testi-avatar">🙎</div><div><div class="testi-name">Kavita Joshi</div><div class="testi-loc">Surat, Gujarat</div></div></div></div>
      <div class="testi-card"><div class="testi-stars">★★★★★</div><p class="testi-text">Amazing quality products! The Kansa thali set transformed our daily meals. The sharbat flavours are incredible — kokam is my absolute favourite.</p><div class="testi-author"><div class="testi-avatar">👩</div><div><div class="testi-name">Aarti Patel</div><div class="testi-loc">Vadodara, Gujarat</div></div></div></div>
      <div class="testi-card"><div class="testi-stars">★★★★★</div><p class="testi-text">Gamtu's organic products have become a staple in our household. The ghee smells exactly like what my grandmother used to make. Authenticity at its best!</p><div class="testi-author"><div class="testi-avatar">👨</div><div><div class="testi-name">Suresh Desai</div><div class="testi-loc">Rajkot, Gujarat</div></div></div></div>
      <div class="testi-card"><div class="testi-stars">★★★★★</div><p class="testi-text">The instant mixes are such a time saver without compromising on health. As a working mother, Gamtu is a blessing. The Jain range is especially thoughtful.</p><div class="testi-author"><div class="testi-avatar">👩‍💼</div><div><div class="testi-name">Neha Kothari</div><div class="testi-loc">Pune, Maharashtra</div></div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="testi-nav-row">
    <button class="testi-arrow" id="testiPrev">&#8592;</button>
